# Line endings: LF in the repo and in every working tree, on every OS.
# Added 2026-09-07 when all tracked text blobs were already LF, so this
# rewrites no history — it only stops core.autocrlf=true (the Git for
# Windows default) from checking files out as CRLF, which made the same
# file differ between a Windows and a Linux clone without anyone editing
# it. Windows batch files are the one exception: cmd.exe wants CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
